      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/14/business/google-gemini-ai-schools.html</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/14/business/google-gemini-ai-schools.html</guid>
      <atom:link href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/14/business/google-gemini-ai-schools.html" rel="standout"></atom:link>
      <description>Google enabled A.I. features for K-12 schools that have allowed student access to Gemini. Until this week, Google automatically enabled Gemini in Classroom only for students 18 or older.</description>
